==History==
2016
*The Guards [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 3/5/2016, in the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]].
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Guards' hitpoints and damage by 8%.
*On 21/6/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (21/6/2016)|Balance Update]], removed the Guards' pushback when their shields break.
2017
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic%20Quests%20Update%20(9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], fixed a bug where the [[Inferno Tower]]'s and [[Inferno Dragon]]'s damage did not reset after breaking the Guards' shield. This change was reverted on 11/10/2017, in a [[Version History#Maintenance%20Break%20(11/10/2017)|maintenance break]].
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], increased the Guards’ hitpoints and damage by 5% and decreased their attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.2 seconds). It also made it so that the Inferno Tower's and Inferno Dragon's would now reset after breaking the Guards' shield.
2018 
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
2020
*On 2/6/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (2/6/2020)|Balance Update]], gave the Guards a new 0.1 seconds deploy stagger from each other.
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Guards' attack time interval to 1 second (from 1.1 seconds) and decreased their hitpoints by 26%.
2021 
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Guards from Royal Arena to Spooky Town.
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, added a card render to the Guards' card info screen.
*On 6/9/2021, the [[Version History#2021%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(6/9/2021)|2021 Quarter 3 Update]], increased the Guards' damage by 12%.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Guards from Spooky Town to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2024
*On 3/1/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (3/1/2024)|Balance Update]], increased the Guards' shield hitpoints by 7%.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Guards' damage by 0.82%. It also made it so that Guards' spawn formation would be correctly mirrored depending on which side of the Arena they were placed.
*On 5/5/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]], decreased the Guards' damage by 4%.
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Guards.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]], decreased the Guards' First Hit Speed to 0.5 second (from 0.4 seconds)

